# AIWORLD

> AIWORLD provides portable in-vehicle technology that adds wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto to compatible cars without replacing the factory stereo.

AIWORLD serves drivers who want a portable display for navigation, calls, messages, music, and parking assistance. Buyers should verify vehicle power, phone compatibility, audio routing, mounting space, and rear-camera requirements before ordering.

