## Products

- [AIWORLD 9-Inch Portable Wireless CarPlay Screen](https://aiworldlife.com/products/9-inch-wireless-carplay): Portable touchscreen supporting wireless Apple CarPlay, Android Auto, flexible audio routing, 12V/24V vehicle power, and compatible rear cameras.
- [AIWORLD 17.2mm Universal Suction Cup Mount](https://aiworldlife.com/products/aiworld-17-2mm-universal-suction-cup-mount-for-9-inch-carplay-screen): Adjustable 360-degree dashboard or windshield mount for compatible 9-inch displays using a 17.2mm ball-joint connection.
- [AIWORLD Universal CD Slot Mount](https://aiworldlife.com/products/aiworld-universal-cd-slot-mount-for-9-inch-carplay-screen): No-drill adjustable holder that mounts a compatible 9-inch portable CarPlay screen through an accessible vehicle CD slot.

